From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:39:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 43/44] minimize: media line only on the window that shows the
 media

One MPRIS player can serve every window of a process (Firefox has one per
process), so with several windows of the app the media line went to the
active window even when another window played it. A player now goes to the
window with its pid, else the window whose title contains the media title
(the active one when several do), else to none. The only window of an app
still takes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

